    <p class="eyebrow">Making IT Easy</p>
    <h1>Your Local IT Dude</h1>
    <p class="lead">
Reliable IT support, Microsoft 365, cloud solutions, and cybersecurity for small businesses in Regensburg and the surrounding area.
    </p>
