      <article>
        <h3>IT Support</h3>
        <p>Responsive assistance for everyday IT issues, user management, devices, printers, networks, and ongoing technical support.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Microsoft 365 & Cloud</h3>
        <p>Secure Microsoft 365 setup, email migration, cloud storage, collaboration tools, and identity management.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Cybersecurity & Backups</h3>
        <p>Protect your business with multi-factor authentication, endpoint security, reliable backups, and best-practice security measures.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section index-feed" aria-labelledby="why-itdudesolutions">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Why ITDudeSolutions?</p>
      <h2 id="latest-works">Simple IT</h2>
      <!-- <a class="text-link" href={withBase('/works/')}>All works</a> -->
